    Notification icons are drawn from the alpha channel alone, so this one is a transparent sheet
    with white brackets: the system paints it in the status bar's own colour. `ic_scan` is a fully
    opaque picture — right for the bubble it also serves, where the whole bitmap is drawn — and using
    it here produced the solid white square the status bar showed instead of an icon.
-->
